# A reusable technical report

**Strike documentation team**, September 2026

## Abstract

This report is a template for documents that must remain readable in both a
browser and a paged PDF. It separates a full-width abstract and contents from
a source-ordered, two-column body. Its companion `paper.sxh` supplies a serif
face, a narrower measure, generous leading, and three reusable command groups.
The exercise tests the same source against two renderers without asking the
author to write separate versions of the report.

**Keywords:** document structure, column flow, typography, reusable components

## Contents

- [Question](#question)
